# Optional. If set, pre-fills the Integrations backend URL in Profile so an
# admin doesn't have to type it in manually after every deploy. Leave unset
# and it just falls back to the manual field, same as before.
#
# This must point at your deployed psp-integrations-backend (see that
# project's own README) — it is NOT this app's own URL.
VITE_BACKEND_URL=
